      "summaries": {
        "en": "FreeCAD is an open-source parametric 3D CAD modeler that enables engineers and designers to create precise digital models without proprietary software costs. Its parametric approach links design parameters to geometry, allowing easy modifications by adjusting values rather than redrawing shapes. You can use it for mechanical engineering, architecture, or 3D printing projects through its modular workbenches, which support specialized tasks like finite element analysis and BIM workflows.",
        "zh": "FreeCAD是一款开源参数化3D CAD建模器，让工程师和设计师无需昂贵商业软件即可创建精确数字模型。其核心采用参数化设计方法，将几何形状与可调整参数关联，修改设计时只需更新数值而非重建模型，极大提升了设计迭代效率。通过模块化工作台系统，用户可进行机械设计、建筑信息建模、有限元分析等专业任务，并直接导出文件用于3D打印或工程仿真，适合从教育到专业领域的跨平台三维创作需求。",
        "es": "FreeCAD is an open-source parametric 3D CAD modeler that enables engineers and designers to create precise digital models without proprietary software costs. Its parametric approach links design parameters to geometry, allowing easy modifications by adjusting values rather than redrawing shapes. You can use it for mechanical engineering, architecture, or 3D printing projects through its modular workbenches, which support specialized tasks like finite element analysis and BIM workflows.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "FreeCAD stands out for 3d, 3d-printing, and architecture in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "FreeCAD is an open-source parametric 3D CAD modeler that enables engineers and designers to create precise digital models without proprietary software costs. Its parametric approach links design parameters to geometry, allowing easy modifications by adjusting values rather than redrawing shapes. You can use it for mechanical engineering, architecture, or 3D printing projects through its modular workbenches, which support specialized tasks like finite element analysis and BIM workflows.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
