      "summaries": {
        "en": "Onyx is an open-source AI platform that solves the fragmentation problem in LLM deployment by providing a unified interface for working with any large language model. Its technical strength lies in a modular architecture that separates core components like chat UI, enterprise search, and RAG capabilities, allowing developers to mix-and-match features. You can deploy it locally or on-premises to build custom AI assistants, integrate with existing data sources for retrieval-augmented applications, or extend its Python/Next.js codebase to create specialized enterprise solutions.",
        "zh": "Onyx是一个开源AI平台，通过统一接口支持各类大语言模型，解决了模型部署碎片化问题。其模块化架构将聊天界面、企业搜索和检索增强生成等功能分离，支持灵活组合。用户可本地或私有化部署，连接数据源构建智能检索应用，或基于Python/Next.js代码库扩展功能，创建定制化企业级AI解决方案。该设计降低了多模型集成复杂度，保持了系统扩展性，适合技术团队探索定制AI能力。",
        "es": "Onyx is an open-source AI platform that solves the fragmentation problem in LLM deployment by providing a unified interface for working with any large language model. Its technical strength lies in a modular architecture that separates core components like chat UI, enterprise search, and RAG capabilities, allowing developers to mix-and-match features. You can deploy it locally or on-premises to build custom AI assistants, integrate with existing data sources for retrieval-augmented applications, or extend its Python/Next.js codebase to create specialized enterprise solutions.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "onyx stands out for ai, ai-chat, and chatgpt in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Onyx is an open-source AI platform that solves the fragmentation problem in LLM deployment by providing a unified interface for working with any large language model. Its technical strength lies in a modular architecture that separates core components like chat UI, enterprise search, and RAG capabilities, allowing developers to mix-and-match features. You can deploy it locally or on-premises to build custom AI assistants, integrate with existing data sources for retrieval-augmented applications, or extend its Python/Next.js codebase to create specialized enterprise solutions.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/onyx-dot-app/onyx for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
